  "description": "The Broiler.VM WebAssembly language profile. It carries an identity, a decoder for the binary format, a validator, a translator of a validated module into universal bytecode, and the universal bytecode family that runs it over the four numeric types, locals, globals, one linear memory, structured control flow, direct and indirect calls. It has no linker and admits no import, no manifest has been scored against the specification's own conformance suite, and the status ledger under docs/ is the authority for what exists.",
